@startuml alternative_component
title Target picture: mw::com first, one forwarding path, one daemon contract\nGrouped by owning repository

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<ASIL-B>> #FFE6E6
  BackgroundColor<<QM>> #E6F0FF
  BackgroundColor<<external>> #F2F2F2
  BackgroundColor<<open>> #FFF8DC
  BackgroundColor<<retired>> #D9D9D9
}

package "Application repos (integrator)" as APPS {
  component "Application A\n(mw::com API)" as AppA
  component "Application B\n(mw::com API)" as AppB
}

package "eclipse-score/communication (mw::com and shared bindings)" as COM {
  component "LoLa binding\n(zero-copy, same host)" as Lola
  component "SOME/IP binding\n(shared library)" as SomeBind
  component "DDS binding\n(shared library)" as DdsBind
  component "Serializer plugin\n(shared, per service type)" as Ser
  component "Forwarding\n(generic proxy, transport,\nskeleton; from mw::com gateway)" as Fwd
  component "Daemon service IF\n(mw::com services)" as DIF
}

package "eclipse-score/inc_someip_gateway" as GWR {
  component "gatewayd\n(ASIL-B: E2E, policy, ACL, config;\nno forwarding code of its own)" as GW <<ASIL-B>>
  component "socom\n(retired, replaced by Daemon service IF)" as Socom <<retired>>
  component "someipd\n(stack daemon, one per host)" as SomeIPD <<QM>> {
    component "SOME/IP-SD and protocol\n(behind Daemon service IF)" as Proto <<QM>>
    component "Transport plugin\n(sockets)" as Sock <<QM>>
    component "Transport plugin\n(io-sock fast path, optional)" as Fast <<QM>>
  }
}

package "DDS repo (open decision)" as DDSR {
  component "ddsd\n(DDS Communication Daemon, one per host)" as DDSD <<QM>> {
    component "DDS integration\n(behind DDS IF)" as DDSI <<QM>>
  }
}

package "External dependencies" as EXT {
  component "vsomeip 3.7.6\n(current default)" as VS <<external>>
  component "lg-someip\n(proposed: dependency of someipd,\nlocation open)" as LG <<open>>
  component "io-sock (QNX)" as IOS <<external>>
  component "Cyclone DDS" as CYC <<external>>
}

cloud "Vehicle network" as Net

AppA --> Lola : same host
AppA --> SomeBind : direct placement
Lola --> AppB : same host

GW --> Fwd : forwards events
Fwd --> Lola : local side
Fwd --> SomeBind : remote side
Fwd --> DdsBind : remote side (DDS)
Fwd --> Ser : payload
SomeBind --> Ser : payload
DdsBind --> Ser : payload

SomeBind --> DIF : daemon contract
DdsBind --> DIF : daemon contract
DIF --> SomeIPD : daemon contract
DIF --> DDSD : same contract

Socom ..> DIF : replaced by

Proto ..> VS : links (current)
Proto ..> LG : links (proposed)
Proto --> Sock : transport IF
Proto ..> Fast : optional, per route
Fast ..> IOS : kernel sockets
DDSI ..> CYC : links

Sock --> Net
Fast --> Net
DDSI --> Net

note bottom of COM
  D1 mw::com first: same host = LoLa,
     other ECU = shared SOME/IP or DDS binding,
     placed in the app or in gatewayd.
  D2 One forwarding path, not one per gateway.
  D3 Daemon contract on mw::com; socom retired
     once mw::com has generic methods
     (communication#767).
  D6 Serializer is a shared plugin.
end note

note bottom of GWR
  D4 gatewayd is used only for apps that cannot use
     mw::com directly, and for central E2E and policy.
  D5 One protocol daemon per protocol per host.
     Protocol logic only in someipd.
  D7 io-sock fast path stays optional until measured.
end note

note bottom of APPS
  Specs and decisions: eclipse-score/score (no code).
end note
@enduml
